sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant P as Page (Cloudflare Pages)
    participant F as Pages Functions (/api/...)
    participant M as Model server (Render)
    participant R2 as R2 bucket
    participant D1 as D1 database
    U->>P: open the app
    P-->>U: login page (no cookie yet)
    U->>F: POST /api/login (team password)
    F-->>U: cookie with a hash of the password
    U->>P: choose a floor plan, "Find similar plans"
    P->>F: POST /api/search (the plan image)
    F->>M: POST /gradio_api/call/predict (plan as base64)
    Note over M: clean the plan<br/>encode: 128 numbers<br/>5 closest of 5,000
    M-->>F: 5 matches (ids, distances, images, room maps)
    F->>R2: store the uploaded plan and the full answer
    F->>D1: INSERT one row into searches
    F-->>P: the result (JSON)
    P-->>U: your plan, its rooms and the 5 similar plans
    P->>F: GET /api/history
    F->>D1: SELECT the 20 latest searches
    F-->>P: past searches (thumbnails from R2)
